# Destroying several permanents at once (CR 701.8a): a regeneration shield made in response saves the Ornithopter it names
# (CR 701.19a), the other artifacts of mana value 0 are destroyed with it. Meltdown does not say they can't be regenerated.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Meltdown
Mountain x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Yavimaya Hollow
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Forest x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Yavimaya Hollow.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Meltdown.Cast(X: 0)
